#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:1
#: 641b4f33b82d44c28889934b4498d1fb
msgid "Quick Demo (Public Path)"
msgstr "快速演示（公开版路径）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:3
#: 7f0ff5751f5846099b377daf6cdf0930
msgid ""
"This guide gets you from zero to a moving robot in the shortest time "
"using the public `open-deploy-ws` workspace."
msgstr "本指南使用公开的 `open-deploy-ws` 工作空间，帮助你以最短时间从零开始让机器人动起来。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:5
#: 324b8729e1024370b9169d1c57d535d6
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:7
#: 90ab9cad69e74750817bf0547f93cd26
msgid "Ubuntu 24.04"
msgstr "Ubuntu 24.04"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:8
#: 32fee5ed389d49b0aea7a7e838382154
msgid ""
"ROS 2 Jazzy installed (see [Install "
"Environment](2-install_environment.md) if needed)"
msgstr "已安装 ROS 2 Jazzy（如需安装，请参阅[环境安装](2-install_environment.md)）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:9
#: b9ea40150c6a474fb90d3bd1065bfe71
msgid "Git with GitHub access"
msgstr "可访问 GitHub 的 Git"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:11
#: 64a7248f08ac46c5a4199e9f56bc1354
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "步骤"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:13
#: b10650887447488ea7995b12a32e6dcb
msgid "1. Clone the Workspace"
msgstr "1. 克隆工作空间"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:15
#: 33218599900c41a0bb2145cc3d69c60f
msgid ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd open-deploy-ws\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd open-deploy-ws\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:21
#: 4b152e6e8aaa4a0b80f3f78be40e6810
msgid "2. Initialize Repository"
msgstr "2. 初始化仓库"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:23
#: 7f0912bcbbca4f01b7cb390d46335ce2
msgid "Run the initialization script:"
msgstr "运行初始化脚本："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:25
#: caef20b20ef347c29f79c3109247ec88
msgid "./init_repo.sh\n"
msgstr "./init_repo.sh\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:29
#: 6ba30b1bd295494b9e87393d559629cc
msgid "The script will:"
msgstr "脚本会："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:31
#: d368e597134a4c31bd3a300aa13e78a8
msgid "Configure submodule visibility (public only by default)"
msgstr "配置子模块可见性（默认仅 public）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:32
#: 4554d2d37deb4ca18fa58c50a60b59f1
msgid "Prompt per core module for `d` (GitHub Release `.deb`) or `s` (source)"
msgstr "按核心模块选择 `d`（GitHub Release `.deb`）或 `s`（源码）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:33
#: f93231acd7e44606a29d86818a3c2a1b
msgid ""
"Sync selected source submodules, run `rosdep install`, and install chosen"
" debs via `scripts/install_core_debs.sh`"
msgstr "同步选为源码的子模块，运行 `rosdep install`，并通过 `scripts/install_core_debs.sh` 安装所选 deb"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:35
#: 7d1f7ee9932b4237a5878a623a6b24e7
msgid ""
"You still need `colcon build` after init. Do **not** follow with a second"
" hand-run `rosdep` unless something failed."
msgstr "init 之后仍需 `colcon build`。除非失败，**不要**再手跑一遍 `rosdep`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:37
#: 96788bed48c5418db2d5e52cd50e594d
msgid "Deb vs Source"
msgstr "Deb 与源码"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:40
#: 61f52ca36ad74a3288be6579d68d2361
msgid ""
"The GitHub Release `.deb` (`ros-jazzy-ocs2`) is faster to install but "
"cannot be modified. Choose source if you need to develop OCS2 itself. "
"OCS2 is not available from packages.ros.org / Ubuntu apt. To **switch** "
"later, re-run `./init_repo.sh` and pick **2) 切换模块安装方式**."
msgstr ""
"GitHub Release `.deb`（`ros-jazzy-ocs2`）安装更快，但无法修改。若要开发 OCS2 本身请选源码。OCS2 "
"不在 packages.ros.org / Ubuntu apt 源中。之后要**切换**，再跑 `./init_repo.sh` 并选 **2)"
" 切换模块安装方式**。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:43
#: bc56520995844daf8704a8b8fc56bcc1
msgid "3. Build the Workspace"
msgstr "3. 编译工作空间"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:45
#: d2f1082ed6474027b8ef6bd4f7bcc0e3
msgid "colcon build --symlink-install\n"
msgstr "colcon build --symlink-install\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:49
#: ce33ea6ea29443b695151b560b7314bc
msgid "This typically takes 10-20 minutes on first build."
msgstr "首次编译通常需要 10-20 分钟。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:51
#: 2e2a35dcd2934e5ca2e4af02139965bc
msgid "4. Source and Launch"
msgstr "4. 加载环境并启动"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:53
#: ace32cd7f3de41279df9e431e6dede10
msgid ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=mock\n"
msgstr ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=mock\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:58
#: 0bfe92cf1d3c401c8a56d21056ed3818
msgid "5. Observe the Demo"
msgstr "5. 观察演示"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:60
#: 59a62d4d2482416e8056a21de935e064
msgid "You should see:"
msgstr "你应该能看到："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:61
#: 6ef3c3e2fae849e3af9433ebf32d91da
msgid "**RViz** window with robot visualization"
msgstr "带有机器人可视化的 **RViz** 窗口"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:62
#: 4c000b510cbb4faca91461d51993b153
msgid "**Terminal** output showing controller status"
msgstr "显示控制器状态的**终端**输出"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:63
#: 4bba5fcf22794f10ba910cf22ab10383
msgid "Robot responding to MPC target commands"
msgstr "机器人响应 MPC 目标指令"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:65
#: 76e41ddc5c1d470c9d6d36cf26bff983
msgid "To send a target pose:"
msgstr "发送目标位姿："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:66
#: 1e790941c8e149099d5728afc1ed586d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# In a new terminal\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 topic pub /target_pose geometry_msgs/msg/PoseStamped \"{header: "
"{frame_id: 'base_link'}, pose: {position: {x: 0.3, y: 0.0, z: 0.4}, "
"orientation: {w: 1.0}}}\" --once\n"
msgstr ""
"# In a new terminal\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 topic pub /target_pose geometry_msgs/msg/PoseStamped \"{header: "
"{frame_id: 'base_link'}, pose: {position: {x: 0.3, y: 0.0, z: 0.4}, "
"orientation: {w: 1.0}}}\" --once\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:72
#: 28727d6bddcf42e994b24cdb037e599e
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:74
#: 9960b696a23e4ac48fe01d0b363107bf
msgid "Build Fails with Missing Packages"
msgstr "编译失败：缺少软件包"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:76
#: 5cfebcc170dd4ecb945f5468cdefbc6d
msgid "Re-run `./init_repo.sh` menu **5) 仅运行 rosdep**, or:"
msgstr "再跑 `./init_repo.sh` 菜单 **5) 仅运行 rosdep**，或："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:78
#: f40ef2e2b723472d98ee99d43b0608e5
msgid "rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -r -y\n"
msgstr "rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -r -y\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:82
#: bee461a2074243fa944d661cde76c294
msgid "OCS2 Package Not Found"
msgstr "找不到 OCS2 软件包"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:84
#: e91314d5f0c34a1a9d6a4b23a6972a4d
msgid ""
"OCS2 is not in the ROS apt index. Re-run `./init_repo.sh`: menu **1** "
"with `d` for OCS2, menu **2** to switch source ↔ deb, or menu **3**:"
msgstr ""
"OCS2 不在 ROS apt 索引中。再跑 `./init_repo.sh`：菜单 **1** 给 OCS2 选 `d`，菜单 **2** "
"在源码 ↔ deb 之间切换，或菜单 **3**："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:86
#: ec5c569fc9c54c87b2645c0e8be482d7
msgid "./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2"
msgstr "./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:90
#: 37d5f79ed5174eacb79749001d63d0d6
msgid "Submodule Errors"
msgstr "子模块错误"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:92
#: c4de739d30624580a634ed7e512d24da
msgid ""
"Re-run `./init_repo.sh` (menu 1) instead of a blind recursive submodule "
"init. The script already syncs selected source modules."
msgstr "再跑 `./init_repo.sh`（菜单 1），不要盲目递归初始化子模块。脚本已经同步你选中的源码模块。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:94
#: 6ff5d5435305475e8145c65ba93e3440
msgid "Workspace Not Sourced"
msgstr "未加载工作空间环境"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:96
#: 9c7121ad4f5a4cc38d42d9acc97b3432
msgid "Always source after opening a new terminal:"
msgstr "打开新终端后务必先加载环境："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md:97
#: be301038277840ad9ac87f8cb033610d
msgid ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"source ~/open-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
msgstr ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"source ~/open-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"

